  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 250eb (Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Fits:</strong> All Bulletproof Shields</p>\n<p><em>To the disdain of extremists, corporate forces rarely limit their gear procurement to that which only defends against low-speed kinetics.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Shield Attachment.</strong> Installing this requires a DV17 Basic Tech Skill Check, and cannot be removed once installed. When a Bulletproof Shield with an Anti-Blast Layer is destroyed by an Explosive, the damage from the Explosive that carries over to the user is halved (Round Up) before interacting with their armor.</p>\n<p><strong>Type:</strong> Shield Attachment<br>\n<strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Shield Attachments and Enhancements follow the Armor Attachment and Enhancement rules, but for Bulletproof Shields, including cyberware ones; not for vehicle Bulletproof Glass. Corgo's optional rule: a Bulletproof Shield with HP left puts its wielder in Cover and counts as a 2x2m/yds piece of Cover against Suppressive Fire, which they may share with one adjacent character.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Armor &amp; Fashion &gt; Shields).</em></p>"
